    "text color" : "[0.13725490868091583, 0.12156862765550613, 0.125490203499794]",
    "content" : "SMBC Friend Securities Co., Ltd. is a securities company with one of the best financial foundations and efficient operations in the industry, and provides a full range of securities services focusing mainly on retail clients. SMBC Friend Securities provides highly efficient nationwide network operations offering services closely tailored to the needs of its clients and the communities while operating a new business model of online financial consulting services."
